'''Beach''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting 13,200 [[Beach Balls (currency)|Beach Balls]] {{Currency|Beach Ball}} during the [[Summer Event 2023|2023 Summer Event]]. It is now only available through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. Its blade is a bright blue with several white lines resembling waves. The guard is blue and the handle is partly the same colour but then switches to a pastel yellow colour, resembling a sandy beach, hence the name.

